# Coppice

Read `COPPICE.md` at the repo root before any edit.

- Keep the existing folder layout. Do not invent src/modules/ unless it already exists.
- Do not add a second library for a job that already has a winner (UI, time, HTTP, DB, state).
- Extend existing features; do not create sibling implementations.
- Do not delete Django apps, migrations, management commands, admin, models, or login pages.
- For CVEs: bump the listed version of the winning library. Do not add a replacement library.
- Remove secrets from the repo.
